---

## 3. Implement GAS Backend

Add:

```text
gas/config/tc-oasis16.c
gas/config/tc-oasis16.h
```

Implement parser support for:

```asm
ADD r1, r2
SUB r3, r4

MVI r1, 123

LDR r1, [r2]
LDR r1, [r2 + 3]

STR r3, [r4]
STR r3, [r4 - 2]

CALL function
JMP label
```

Support labels:

```asm
start:
loop:
done:
```

Support directives:

```asm
.text
.data
.bss
.global
.word
.byte
.align
```

---

## 4. Implement Relocations

Start with only:

### Absolute Relocation

```text
R_OASIS16_ABS16
```

### Branch Relocation

```text
R_OASIS16_PCREL8
```

### Call Relocation

```text
R_OASIS16_CALL
```

Ignore advanced relocation types initially.

---

## 5. Implement BFD Target

Add:

```text
bfd/cpu-oasis16.c
bfd/elf32-oasis16.c
```

Create:

```text
bfd_arch_oasis16
```

Define:

```text
ELF machine type
```

Use a temporary custom machine number initially.

---

## 6. Implement Linker Target

Add:

```text
ld/emulparams/oasis16elf.sh
```

Add:

```text
ld/scripttempl/oasis16.sc
```

Default memory map:

```text
.text
.rodata
.data
.bss
.stack
```

Simple linker script:

```ld
MEMORY
{
    RAM (rwx) : ORIGIN = 0x0000, LENGTH = 64K
}

SECTIONS
{
    .text : { *(.text*) }
    .rodata : { *(.rodata*) }
    .data : { *(.data*) }
    .bss : { *(.bss*) }
}
```

