# Phase 3 — Minimal Runtime

---

## Runtime Layout

Create:

```text
toolchain/runtime/
```

Contents:

```text
crt0.oas
oasis16.ld

include/stdint.h
include/stddef.h

libgcc-stubs/
```

---

## crt0 Responsibilities

On reset:

### 1. Initialize Stack

```asm
MOV SP, STACK_TOP
```

### 2. Clear BSS

```text
zero .bss
```

### 3. Initialize Data

Copy:

```text
ROM -> RAM
```

if needed.

### 4. Call Main

```asm
CALL main
```

### 5. Halt

```asm
halt:
    JMP halt
```

---

## Linker Script

Provide:

```text
__stack_top
__bss_start
__bss_end
__data_start
__data_end
```

symbols.

---

## Phase 3 Acceptance Criteria

```bash
oasis16-elf-gcc \
    -ffreestanding \
    -nostdlib \
    crt0.o \
    main.c \
    -T oasis16.ld \
    -o main.elf
```

links successfully.

