# Implementation Priority

1. Finish Binutils
2. Make GAS assemble OASIS instructions
3. Make LD generate ELF
4. Make GCC emit valid assembly
5. Build freestanding runtime
6. Automate Darwin build
7. Add Linux host support
8. Add ELF-to-image conversion
9. Expand language/runtime support

Binutils is the critical path. GCC should not be expanded until assembly, linking, relocations, and ELF generation are functioning reliably.